         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_e66119c9-aaaf-f25b-e053-2a95a90a2c4f">
               <id root="fa3f49ab-4ed6-5fef-e053-6394a90a5506"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>
                  <content styleCode="italics">
                     <content styleCode="bold">Directions</content>
                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <br/>
Do not give more than directed, this product does not contain directions or complete warnings for adult use, find right dose on
  <br/>
chart below. If possible, use weight to dose; otherwise, use age. Repeat dose every 4 hours while symptoms last, do not give more than 5 times in 24 hours. Attention use only enclosed dosing cup specifically designed for use with this product. Do not use any other dosing device.
  <br/>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
                  <table border="0" width="100%">
                     <tbody>
                        <tr>
                           <td>
                              <content styleCode="bold">Weight (lbs)</content>
                           </td>
                           <td>
                              <content styleCode="bold">Age (Years)</content>
                           </td>
                           <td>
                              <content styleCode="bold">Dose</content>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>under 24 lbs.</td>
                           <td>under 2 years</td>
                           <td>Ask a doctor</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>24-35 lbs.</td>
                           <td>2 - 3 years</td>
                           <td>
                              <paragraph>5 mL</paragraph>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>36-47 lbs.</td>
                           <td>4-5 years</td>
                           <td>7.5</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>48-59 lbs.</td>
                           <td>6-10 Years</td>
                           <td>
                              <paragraph>10 mL</paragraph>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>60-71 lbs</td>
                           <td>9-10 years</td>
                           <td>
                              <paragraph>12.5 mL</paragraph>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>72-95 lbs</td>
                           <td>11 years</td>
                           <td>15 ml</td>
                        </tr>
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
                  <paragraph/>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20230401"/>
            </section>
         </component>
